  m_text: "Controls:\r\nWASD - Move\r\nF - Flashlight\r\nE - Push cart / Escape\r\n\rLeft
    Click - pick up item, lock the mouse\nRight Click - Submit items\nLeft shift
    - run\nUse the cart to collect the items. After collecting enough items, push
    the cart to the green submission point to submit them. Then run back to the starting
    point and press 'E' to escape.\nDon't let the sanity level be too low; terrifying
    things could happen.\n"
